  "fullDescription": "Mahrine Prestige is a refined duo font that combines a high-contrast serif with a flowing script, designed to create a timeless and luxurious typographic look.\nThe serif features clean structure, elegant proportions, and sharp contrast, making it perfect for sophisticated headlines and editorial layouts. Meanwhile, the script brings a graceful touch with smooth curves and expressive swashes, adding personality without overpowering the design.\nTogether, they create a harmonious pairing that works beautifully across a wide range of creative projects.\n\nPerfect for:\n– Branding & logo design\n– Editorial & magazine layouts\n– Wedding invitations\n– Luxury packaging\n– Social media & marketing materials\n\nFeatures:\n– A – Z set (Uppercase & Lowercase)\n– Number\n– Punctuation\n– Alternates\n– Ligatures\n– Multilingual\n– Mahrine Prestige Characters Map\n\nFile type:\n– Mahrine Prestige Serif (OTF, TTF, WOFF)\n– Mahrine Prestige Script (OTF, TTF, WOFF)",
